# codecs/json: to-json-pretty handles empty dict and array compactly
[include %libdir "codecs/json.llt"]

---

[j1: [%.to-json-pretty []]]
[j2: [%.to-json-pretty []]]
[j3: [%.to-json-pretty [x: [] y: []]]]

[empty-dict: j1  empty-array: j2  nested: j3]
=== out
Dict({"empty-dict": String("null"), "empty-array": String("null"), "nested": String("{\n  \"x\": null,\n  \"y\": null\n}")})
